WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:43.000 --> 01:48.000
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.080 --> 01:51.000
[Episode 24]

4
02:12.220 --> 02:13.130
Fu Shize,

5
02:13.720 --> 02:15.340
where on earth are you?

6
02:15.370 --> 02:16.410
Why can't you

7
02:16.410 --> 02:17.750
stay by my side

8
02:17.750 --> 02:19.030
like Yunyi?

9
03:17.710 --> 03:18.400
Lili.

10
03:34.390 --> 03:38.040
♪ Dust upon time ♪

11
03:36.030 --> 03:37.240
Let's break up.

12
03:38.880 --> 03:41.430
♪ Every step soft and slow ♪

13
03:43.250 --> 03:46.430
♪ The room holds my profile ♪

14
03:47.350 --> 03:50.750
♪ Passing no verdict for anyone ♪

15
03:55.079 --> 03:55.630
Is it because

16
03:55.630 --> 03:56.930
I didn't go to see you?

17
04:01.430 --> 04:02.680
That's one reason.

18
04:03.310 --> 04:04.510
But there are others.

19
04:06.960 --> 04:07.630
I'm sorry.

20
04:09.410 --> 04:11.340
I've been busy these past two days.

21
04:13.930 --> 04:15.020
With what?

22
04:17.740 --> 04:19.010
Lili, I...

23
04:19.220 --> 04:20.540
It's just like before.

24
04:20.540 --> 04:21.630
You can't say anything,

25
04:21.630 --> 04:22.370
can you?

26
04:23.580 --> 04:24.380
Fu Shize.

27
04:26.040 --> 04:27.420
Whenever you have a problem,

28
04:27.420 --> 04:28.980
you never tell me.

29
04:30.040 --> 04:30.870
There are so many things about you

30
04:30.870 --> 04:32.540
that I don't know.

31
04:36.830 --> 04:37.980
Now that I need you,

32
04:37.980 --> 04:39.580
you're not by my side either.

33
04:43.570 --> 04:44.370
I'm sorry.

34
04:46.390 --> 04:47.260
I'm tired.

35
04:48.990 --> 04:50.300
You have your own world

36
04:50.320 --> 04:51.720
that I can never get into.

37
04:52.310 --> 04:54.040
And I don't want to try so hard

38
04:54.040 --> 04:55.330
to squeeze in anymore.

39
05:00.240 --> 05:01.100
Let's break up.

40
05:03.010 --> 05:05.540
I've... decided to study abroad.

41
05:04.780 --> 05:06.820
♪ I'm in the dark of night ♪

42
05:06.840 --> 05:09.040
♪ Let all my thoughts settle down ♪

43
05:09.060 --> 05:12.050
♪ Practise pretending I don't miss you ♪

44
05:13.250 --> 05:15.570
♪ Maybe one day ♪

45
05:15.590 --> 05:17.850
♪ Be a little more honest ♪

46
05:17.870 --> 05:21.610
♪ Will it be fulfilled? ♪

47
05:22.040 --> 05:26.230
♪ Half my heart kept hidden ♪

48
05:22.600 --> 05:23.270
Okay.

49
05:26.270 --> 05:30.030
♪ Bargain with solitude ♪

50
05:30.560 --> 05:34.390
♪ If you turn back to see ♪

51
05:34.409 --> 05:38.500
♪ Give back all the regret ♪

52
05:39.980 --> 05:45.430
♪ The story is not finished yet ♪

53
05:47.480 --> 05:49.480
♪ Half drifting apart ♪

54
05:49.680 --> 05:51.680
♪ Half a hug we share ♪

55
05:51.770 --> 05:55.430
♪ A goodnight too late ♪

56
05:55.740 --> 05:57.940
♪ Let the moon be half-lit ♪

57
05:58.170 --> 06:00.460
♪ Clouds half-hidden too ♪

58
05:59.830 --> 06:01.160
Maybe it's for the best.

59
06:01.950 --> 06:09.710
♪ Let me brave once more ♪

60
06:44.620 --> 06:45.270
Yun Ye?

61
06:46.120 --> 06:46.980
You're awake?

62
06:48.950 --> 06:49.980
Yunyi?

63
06:51.510 --> 06:52.570
How do you feel?

64
06:54.580 --> 06:55.400
I'm okay.

65
06:57.110 --> 06:58.440
What doesn't kill you

66
06:59.380 --> 07:00.910
makes you stronger, right?

67
07:05.900 --> 07:07.610
Don't cry.

68
07:08.760 --> 07:09.560
Don't cry.

69
07:10.920 --> 07:13.070
I'm so afraid of seeing you cry.

70
07:14.040 --> 07:15.220
When you cry,

71
07:16.310 --> 07:18.330
I feel worse than you do.

72
07:19.500 --> 07:21.540
In my current state,

73
07:22.250 --> 07:23.690
I can't even get up

74
07:23.690 --> 07:25.310
to act like a monkey for you.

75
07:30.330 --> 07:31.130
Alright.

76
07:31.870 --> 07:33.040
I won't cry.

77
07:36.480 --> 07:37.740
Does it hurt?

78
07:38.310 --> 07:39.270
Seeing you,

79
07:40.420 --> 07:41.830
it doesn't hurt anymore.

80
07:44.980 --> 07:47.040
When did you get here?

81
07:47.830 --> 07:49.960
My brother brought me here yesterday.

82
07:50.430 --> 07:52.870
You've been here with me for a whole day?

83
07:54.680 --> 07:56.040
I wanted you to see me

84
07:56.040 --> 07:57.270
as soon as you woke up.

85
08:01.630 --> 08:02.560
Are you alright?

86
08:03.630 --> 08:04.770
Does the wound hurt?

87
08:05.620 --> 08:06.880
I'll go get the doctor.

88
08:07.240 --> 08:07.930
Yunyi!

89
08:20.610 --> 08:21.690
Thank you.

90
08:40.440 --> 08:41.620
Still studying?

91
08:45.720 --> 08:47.170
Can't you take a break?

92
08:49.620 --> 08:51.050
I promised Yunyi

93
08:51.050 --> 08:52.910
that we'd get into XUST together.

94
08:53.080 --> 08:54.880
No one can stop me from studying.

95
08:55.790 --> 08:58.340
Can't you study after you recover?

96
08:58.620 --> 08:59.940
Don't get sick again.

97
09:00.010 --> 09:02.340
Otherwise, someone

98
09:02.480 --> 09:03.630
will be sad.

99
09:06.820 --> 09:07.630
Got it.

100
09:09.820 --> 09:11.240
Come on. Eat the porridge first.

101
09:11.240 --> 09:12.300
Put the book aside.

102
09:13.480 --> 09:14.370
Put it away.

103
09:14.840 --> 09:15.300
Come on.

104
09:18.630 --> 09:19.740
Yun Li, you're my sister,

105
09:19.740 --> 09:20.480
not my mom.

106
09:20.480 --> 09:21.680
I can drink it myself.

107
09:22.030 --> 09:23.360
I'll watch you drink it.

108
09:26.540 --> 09:27.790
It's hot. Blow on it.

109
09:29.470 --> 09:29.940
Yun Li,

110
09:29.940 --> 09:31.740
when are you going back to Nanwu?

111
09:32.240 --> 09:32.910
Why?

112
09:33.080 --> 09:34.670
I think you're too noisy here.

113
09:34.670 --> 09:35.320
If you want to be noisy,

114
09:35.320 --> 09:36.840
go be noisy next to your boyfriend,

115
09:36.840 --> 09:37.460
okay?

116
09:37.530 --> 09:39.060
I need some peace and quiet.

117
09:42.980 --> 09:43.600
What's...

118
09:44.340 --> 09:45.370
What's wrong?

119
09:49.670 --> 09:51.980
We... broke up.

120
09:53.900 --> 09:54.860
Broke up?

121
09:54.890 --> 09:55.890
Who brought it up?

122
09:57.910 --> 09:58.770
I did.

123
10:00.170 --> 10:02.580
Didn't you chase him for 7 years?

124
10:02.610 --> 10:04.340
And you just let it go like that?

125
10:05.340 --> 10:06.760
It wasn't that long.

126
10:08.860 --> 10:09.650
Besides,

127
10:10.220 --> 10:11.840
chasing someone is one thing,

128
10:11.840 --> 10:13.170
breaking up is another.

129
10:14.320 --> 10:15.520
They're not the same.

130
10:19.490 --> 10:21.340
Why did you break up with him?

131
10:25.480 --> 10:26.530
Why?

132
10:30.360 --> 10:32.690
He just doesn't like me that much anymore.

133
10:32.870 --> 10:35.870
Did he tell you that,

134
10:35.910 --> 10:37.910
or did you just think that yourself?

135
10:40.940 --> 10:42.480
The problems between us

136
10:43.510 --> 10:45.370
didn't just start a day or two ago.

137
10:45.480 --> 10:47.210
So we broke up. It's no big deal.

138
10:51.870 --> 10:52.600
It's normal for couples

139
10:52.600 --> 10:55.410
to break up.

140
10:58.620 --> 10:59.410
Li.

141
11:06.700 --> 11:07.500
Li.

142
11:08.260 --> 11:09.760
It's okay to be sad.

143
11:10.840 --> 11:12.170
It's not embarrassing.

144
11:14.510 --> 11:16.040
Besides, you still have me.

145
11:17.000 --> 11:18.070
You and Yunyi

146
11:18.620 --> 11:20.370
are both number one in my heart.

147
11:28.100 --> 11:29.450
Don't cry, Li.

148
11:54.620 --> 11:56.620
Why are you drinking during the day?

149
11:57.630 --> 11:59.030
Your stomach has only just gotten better.

150
11:59.030 --> 12:00.440
Do you want to have another surgery?

151
12:00.440 --> 12:02.630
Do I have to drink just because I'm at a bar?

152
12:02.630 --> 12:04.290
Then why did you ask me to come?

153
12:07.820 --> 12:08.630
No reason.

154
12:10.670 --> 12:12.470
Just keep me company for a while.

155
12:14.590 --> 12:15.940
How about I move in with you

156
12:15.940 --> 12:17.540
and stay with you for a while?

157
12:21.630 --> 12:22.490
How about this?

158
12:22.670 --> 12:24.480
I'll have Jiameng book you a flight.

159
12:24.480 --> 12:25.980
Go abroad and cheer yourself up.

160
12:25.980 --> 12:26.770
No need.

161
12:30.190 --> 12:31.100
EAW

162
12:32.530 --> 12:34.190
not going to EAW in the future.

163
12:36.410 --> 12:37.810
You've made up your mind?

164
13:01.320 --> 13:02.130
Hello?

165
13:02.650 --> 13:04.340
How's your packing going?

166
13:04.510 --> 13:05.820
Pretty much done.

167
13:06.320 --> 13:07.410
Do you have a lot of stuff?

168
13:07.410 --> 13:07.980
If you do,

169
13:07.980 --> 13:09.710
I'll have Fu Zhengchu come help you move.

170
13:09.710 --> 13:11.840
It's fine. I can take it all in one trip.

171
13:12.980 --> 13:13.790
Lili,

172
13:14.100 --> 13:16.500
did you guys really just break up like that?

173
13:16.770 --> 13:17.790
You and Fu Shize...

174
13:17.790 --> 13:19.620
I've thought it through.

175
13:21.670 --> 13:22.880
Maybe we're just

176
13:22.910 --> 13:24.310
not right for each other.

177
13:25.620 --> 13:27.820
There's no need to bring him up anymore.

178
13:28.740 --> 13:30.650
Alright, I got it.

179
13:29.570 --> 13:31.920
♪ Lingering right here ♪

180
13:32.180 --> 13:33.690
♪ Who tries to talk me down? ♪

181
13:33.730 --> 13:35.560
♪ Who makes excuses now? ♪

182
13:35.580 --> 13:38.530
♪ Let memories trail in threads ♪

183
13:39.180 --> 13:42.230
♪ Too shattered to pick up ♪

184
13:44.120 --> 13:47.470
♪ Afraid it's too late ♪

185
13:47.680 --> 13:50.720
♪ Willingly I wait ♪

186
13:51.060 --> 13:55.940
♪ To soothe the sorry I said yesterday ♪

187
13:56.520 --> 13:58.480
♪ Half a phrase unspoken ♪

188
13:58.500 --> 14:01.760
♪ Always too late ♪

189
14:01.510 --> 14:05.680
[Delete]

190
14:01.780 --> 14:04.240
♪ Time freezes still ♪

191
14:04.780 --> 14:07.300
♪ My care burns hot ♪

192
14:07.460 --> 14:10.870
♪ Hidden from your sight ♪

193
14:23.920 --> 14:25.670
♪ Some wait for an umbrella ♪

194
14:25.700 --> 14:29.700
♪ Some wait for the sun to show ♪

195
14:30.760 --> 14:36.050
♪ Hesitant feet—which side should I stand on ♪

196
14:38.380 --> 14:41.060
♪ The cold pale moon ♪

197
14:41.080 --> 14:42.670
♪ Never touching the ground ♪

198
14:42.690 --> 14:44.500
♪ Far too out of reach ♪

199
14:44.520 --> 14:47.490
♪ This damp murmur ♪

200
14:47.780 --> 14:52.250
♪ Loud as it is, unheard ♪

201
14:52.900 --> 14:56.110
♪ Afraid it's too late ♪

202
14:56.140 --> 14:59.610
♪ For me to keep my promise ♪

203
14:59.870 --> 15:04.950
♪ Let debts bid farewell to unease ♪

204
15:05.320 --> 15:07.320
♪ We drift apart, each on our way ♪

205
15:07.350 --> 15:10.520
♪ Maybe someday ♪

206
15:10.540 --> 15:13.380
♪ Longing finds its way ♪

207
15:13.460 --> 15:20.060
♪ I hope you write the ending of our tale ♪

208
15:20.720 --> 15:31.180
♪ I hope you write the ending of our tale ♪

209
15:40.390 --> 15:46.180
[One Year Later]

210
15:48.670 --> 15:50.080
The job market is so bad right now.

211
15:50.080 --> 15:51.530
Since you have a place to intern,

212
15:51.530 --> 15:53.030
just work hard there.

213
15:53.030 --> 15:54.890
Don't take time off every few days

214
15:55.240 --> 15:57.240
to shoot those meaningless videos,

215
15:57.740 --> 15:58.410
okay?

216
15:59.080 --> 15:59.980
You only have one month left

217
15:59.980 --> 16:01.530
before your full-time employee evaluation.

218
16:01.530 --> 16:03.270
Don't take it lightly.

219
16:04.010 --> 16:04.890
Got it, Dad.

220
16:04.890 --> 16:05.820
I'll help you

221
16:05.820 --> 16:06.790
keep an eye on Li.

222
16:06.790 --> 16:07.650
I promise.

223
16:07.650 --> 16:08.670
Wait. And you.

224
16:08.820 --> 16:09.820
Getting into college

225
16:09.820 --> 16:11.010
is just the first step

226
16:11.010 --> 16:12.270
toward entering society.

227
16:12.270 --> 16:13.080
At school,

228
16:13.080 --> 16:14.870
you must get along well

229
16:15.010 --> 16:16.120
with your classmates.

230
16:16.120 --> 16:17.130
Yes, Your Majesty.

231
16:17.130 --> 16:18.410
If you don't leave now,

232
16:18.410 --> 16:20.550
you'll really be late for the morning court.

233
16:20.550 --> 16:21.770
-Well... -Alright.

234
16:25.320 --> 16:26.030
You must

235
16:26.030 --> 16:27.220
drive safely.

236
16:27.240 --> 16:28.510
There are a lot of people at school.

237
16:28.510 --> 16:29.340
Yun Li,

238
16:29.340 --> 16:29.870
double-check everything

239
16:29.870 --> 16:30.910
one last time.

240
16:30.910 --> 16:31.560
Don't forget anything.

241
16:31.560 --> 16:32.440
Alright, Dad.

242
16:32.460 --> 16:33.970
You really should go now.

243
16:34.240 --> 16:34.740
Well...

244
16:35.340 --> 16:36.530
It's not like I'm not coming back.

245
16:36.530 --> 16:37.770
Dad is so nagging.

246
16:38.150 --> 16:40.200
We shouldn't have left anything behind, right?

247
16:40.200 --> 16:41.770
Li, I'm going to school,

248
16:41.770 --> 16:43.180
not fleeing from a disaster.

249
16:43.180 --> 16:43.990
Vitamins.

250
16:45.310 --> 16:46.440
Li, hurry up!

251
16:46.460 --> 16:48.860
Don't make Yunyi and the others wait for us.

252
16:56.530 --> 16:57.990
They haven't arrived yet.

253
17:03.980 --> 17:04.910
Hello, Yucheng.

254
17:05.099 --> 17:06.010
Let me help you.

255
17:06.030 --> 17:07.550
No need. I'll handle them.

256
17:07.720 --> 17:08.510
Hello, Li.

257
17:08.640 --> 17:10.140
You're getting prettier, Yunyi.

258
17:10.140 --> 17:11.290
I parked my car over there.

259
17:11.290 --> 17:11.829
Let's go.

260
17:11.829 --> 17:12.349
Okay.

261
17:18.750 --> 17:19.380
So?

262
17:19.380 --> 17:20.810
Did you get some sleep on the plane?

263
17:20.810 --> 17:21.609
Are you tired?

264
17:21.720 --> 17:22.530
I'm fine.

265
17:24.829 --> 17:26.089
When did you come back?

266
17:27.069 --> 17:28.329
More than 2 months ago.

267
17:29.830 --> 17:31.530
How was your time in the UK?

268
17:33.010 --> 17:33.810
Pretty good.

269
17:35.140 --> 17:36.810
You're graduating next year, right?

270
17:36.810 --> 17:38.140
Are you going back soon?

271
17:39.110 --> 17:40.220
The experiments are done.

272
17:40.220 --> 17:40.920
I plan to stay here

273
17:40.920 --> 17:42.010
to finish my thesis

274
17:42.010 --> 17:43.880
and go back for the defense next year.

275
17:43.880 --> 17:45.420
Do you plan to

276
17:45.740 --> 17:47.670
stay and work in Xifu in the future?

277
17:52.830 --> 17:53.740
Are you tired from the flight?

278
17:53.740 --> 17:54.510
It's okay.

279
18:07.530 --> 18:08.330
You guys go first.

280
18:08.330 --> 18:09.070
I'll go park the car.

281
18:09.070 --> 18:10.070
I'll go with you.

282
18:10.070 --> 18:10.830
There are many cars and the road is narrow.

283
18:10.830 --> 18:11.510
It's not very safe.

284
18:11.510 --> 18:12.030
It's fine.

285
18:12.030 --> 18:13.510
Yunyi and Yun Ye are not very familiar with this place.

286
18:13.510 --> 18:14.570
You take them in.

287
18:14.720 --> 18:15.380
I'm going.

288
18:15.680 --> 18:17.050
Li, be careful.

289
18:19.510 --> 18:20.310
Let's go.

290
19:51.550 --> 19:53.400
Senior, here. Have some water.

291
19:56.240 --> 19:57.840
Do you want some water? Here.

292
20:26.510 --> 20:27.030
Hello?

293
20:27.330 --> 20:28.140
Hello, Li.

294
20:28.250 --> 20:29.200
We've finished registering.

295
20:29.200 --> 20:30.530
Why aren't you here yet?

296
20:31.440 --> 20:32.200
Wait a minute.

297
20:32.200 --> 20:33.400
I'm driving over now.

298
20:33.630 --> 20:34.440
Okay.

299
20:59.530 --> 21:00.900
Morning, Senior.

300
21:01.200 --> 21:01.790
Morning.

301
21:02.610 --> 21:03.410
It's just you?

302
21:03.930 --> 21:04.730
Just me.

303
21:06.400 --> 21:07.200
Senior,

304
21:08.220 --> 21:09.520
on your way here,

305
21:09.660 --> 21:11.160
did any pretty girls

306
21:11.160 --> 21:12.290
ask for your WeChat?

307
21:15.330 --> 21:16.440
I'm not like you.

308
21:16.500 --> 21:17.240
I didn't return to school

309
21:17.240 --> 21:18.500
to date.

310
21:21.740 --> 21:22.530
Senior,

311
21:22.530 --> 21:24.130
do you have a girlfriend now?

312
21:24.810 --> 21:25.940
Then why haven't I seen

313
21:25.940 --> 21:27.540
anyone come looking for you?

314
21:32.940 --> 21:34.090
You must get the data

315
21:34.090 --> 21:34.830
done today.

316
21:36.740 --> 21:37.800
I'm going to class.

317
21:38.960 --> 21:40.420
Yes, Teaching Assistant.

318
21:54.290 --> 21:55.440
What's up?

319
21:55.750 --> 21:57.640
Li, I left my materials at home.

320
21:57.640 --> 21:58.440
I need them this afternoon.

321
21:58.440 --> 21:59.640
Can you bring them to me?

322
21:59.640 --> 22:00.350
I don't have time.

323
22:00.350 --> 22:01.610
I'm writing my thesis.

324
22:02.260 --> 22:03.220
Please.

325
22:03.250 --> 22:05.050
If I don't have my textbook on the first day of school,

326
22:05.050 --> 22:06.640
what will the teacher think of me?

327
22:06.640 --> 22:08.290
Yun Ye, can you grow up a little?

328
22:08.290 --> 22:09.290
I finally have a day off today.

329
22:09.290 --> 22:09.590
Can you

330
22:09.590 --> 22:11.250
stop exploiting your sister?

331
22:12.070 --> 22:13.090
We're about to have class.

332
22:13.090 --> 22:14.550
We're about to have class.

333
22:15.110 --> 22:16.180
Thanks, Li. Love you.

334
22:16.180 --> 22:17.350
Finger heart. Mwah, mwah.

335
22:17.350 --> 22:18.850
What? Come on!

336
22:21.330 --> 22:22.140
Yun Ye!

337
22:24.130 --> 22:25.790
I'm not going to listen to you.

338
22:29.460 --> 22:30.460
Darn it.

339
22:32.650 --> 22:35.250
You should be my older brother in the next life.

340
22:46.250 --> 22:47.980
Yun Li, why aren't you here yet?

341
22:48.560 --> 22:50.420
Doesn't it take time to get there?

342
22:52.690 --> 22:54.200
I asked for help in the QQ group.

343
22:52.790 --> 22:59.810
[Xifu University of Science and Technology, School of Control Science and Engineering]

344
22:54.420 --> 22:56.110
The teaching assistant said he'd bring it over.

345
22:56.110 --> 22:57.110
He's in the School of Control Science and Engineering.

346
22:57.110 --> 22:58.310
Can you give it to him?

347
22:59.140 --> 22:59.790
Yun Ye,

348
23:00.250 --> 23:01.640
you'd better pray that

349
23:01.640 --> 23:03.770
you don't have to come home for a while.

350
23:53.460 --> 23:54.000
Lili.

351
23:57.940 --> 23:59.800
I'm here to get Yun Ye's textbook.

352
24:14.250 --> 24:15.580
How have you been doing?

353
24:16.570 --> 24:18.240
Yeah, I'm doing well.

354
24:22.000 --> 24:22.930
Do you have time?

355
24:23.400 --> 24:25.060
Want to grab a drink together?

356
24:26.640 --> 24:27.290
I have

357
24:27.290 --> 24:28.750
other things to do in a bit.

358
24:33.110 --> 24:34.900
The teaching building is quite far from here.

359
24:34.900 --> 24:36.100
Can you give me a ride?

360
24:38.900 --> 24:41.560
That way, I can get the textbook to Yun Ye sooner.

361
24:43.850 --> 24:44.530
Okay.

362
25:06.240 --> 25:06.770
Thanks.

363
25:37.740 --> 25:38.530
Is it here?

364
25:40.460 --> 25:41.050
Yeah.

365
25:54.940 --> 25:55.740
You're here.

366
25:57.910 --> 25:59.110
It's been a long time.

367
26:00.960 --> 26:02.220
Don't you want to talk?

368
26:07.790 --> 26:10.700
Talk... about what?

369
26:16.250 --> 26:17.050
Never mind.

370
26:17.460 --> 26:19.060
I haven't figured it out yet.

371
26:21.440 --> 26:22.960
Let's get together some other time.

372
26:22.960 --> 26:24.820
I'll give the book to Yun Ye first.

373
26:26.270 --> 26:26.960
Okay.

374
26:56.850 --> 26:58.710
He has really moved on, hasn't he?

375
27:12.140 --> 27:12.830
Lili.

376
27:13.000 --> 27:13.790
Lili.

377
27:14.000 --> 27:14.930
Long time no see.

378
27:16.230 --> 27:17.700
Why are you in Xifu?

379
27:20.200 --> 27:21.000
Lili.

380
27:21.400 --> 27:22.250
Tangy and I

381
27:22.250 --> 27:23.640
have been in a long-distance relationship for a year.

382
27:23.640 --> 27:23.960
We finally

383
27:23.960 --> 27:25.200
have a chance to spend time together.

384
27:25.200 --> 27:26.770
So I can't give up this opportunity.

385
27:26.770 --> 27:27.260
I'm planning

386
27:27.260 --> 27:28.740
to apply to grad school in Xifu,

387
27:28.740 --> 27:31.330
so I'm getting familiar with the environment.

388
27:31.330 --> 27:32.790
Are you applying for XUST?

389
27:33.790 --> 27:35.290
I wouldn't dare to think about XUST.

390
27:35.290 --> 27:36.750
How can I compare to Uncle?

391
27:37.550 --> 27:38.350
By the way,

392
27:38.740 --> 27:40.460
Uncle is doing his PhD at XUST.

393
27:40.460 --> 27:41.460
Have you seen him?

394
27:41.940 --> 27:42.740
No.

395
27:42.900 --> 27:44.300
We haven't been in touch.

396
27:45.590 --> 27:47.090
Shut your big mouth.

397
27:48.090 --> 27:49.290
He doesn't think before he speaks.

398
27:49.290 --> 27:50.050
If you have a problem with him,

399
27:50.050 --> 27:51.200
I'll tell him to leave.

400
27:51.200 --> 27:52.020
It's fine.

401
27:52.370 --> 27:53.370
It's been so long.

402
27:53.390 --> 27:54.850
I'm quite happy to see him.

403
28:00.790 --> 28:01.590
Fu Zhengchu.

404
28:02.400 --> 28:03.200
Here.

405
28:04.550 --> 28:05.440
I'm thirsty.

406
28:05.660 --> 28:07.260
What would you like to drink?

407
28:08.790 --> 28:10.720
Lili, what would you like to drink?

408
28:11.590 --> 28:12.160
Juice?

409
28:12.350 --> 28:12.940
Okay.

410
28:15.790 --> 28:16.830
Impressive.

411
28:16.830 --> 28:19.790
You've got Fu Zhengchu completely wrapped around your finger.

412
28:19.790 --> 28:20.720
Watch and learn.

413
28:23.620 --> 28:25.620
What did you want to tell me just now?

414
28:29.140 --> 28:32.460
Actually, I did run into Fu Shize.

415
28:32.920 --> 28:35.200
He's the teaching assistant for Yun Ye's class now.

416
28:35.200 --> 28:36.330
What a coincidence.

417
28:38.790 --> 28:39.830
So how did you feel

418
28:39.830 --> 28:40.830
when you saw him?

419
28:41.480 --> 28:44.590
It just felt very unreal.

420
28:47.240 --> 28:49.660
I felt like he'd changed a lot,

421
28:49.880 --> 28:51.610
like he was a different person.

422
28:54.420 --> 28:56.480
Rather than feeling like the present isn't real,

423
28:56.480 --> 28:57.480
it's more like

424
28:58.250 --> 28:59.350
the 6 months

425
28:59.350 --> 29:00.480
I spent with him

426
29:00.680 --> 29:01.550
were unreal.

427
29:01.730 --> 29:03.010
It was like a dream.

428
29:03.700 --> 29:04.530
You made it sound like

429
29:04.530 --> 29:06.030
his soul was swapped.

430
29:12.900 --> 29:14.240
You don't want to get back together with him, do you?

431
29:14.240 --> 29:15.030
No.

432
29:16.660 --> 29:18.290
I don't like him anymore.

433
29:19.250 --> 29:20.050
That's good.

434
29:26.640 --> 29:27.330
Hello?

435
29:27.810 --> 29:28.940
Li, where are you?

436
29:28.940 --> 29:29.610
My class is over.

437
29:29.610 --> 29:31.610
Wait a minute. I'll come pick you up.

438
29:32.460 --> 29:34.290
Tangy, I'll get going now.

439
29:34.400 --> 29:36.530
You're leaving right after I got here?

440
29:38.300 --> 29:39.830
Then be careful on the road.

441
29:40.240 --> 29:41.790
Watch out for...

442
29:45.140 --> 29:46.380
Lili, where are you going?

443
29:46.380 --> 29:48.240
I'm going to pick up my brother from class.

444
29:48.240 --> 29:48.970
Your juice.

445
29:49.350 --> 29:50.440
Thanks. Bye-bye.

446
29:50.440 --> 29:50.980
Bye-bye.

447
29:59.740 --> 30:00.540
What's wrong?

448
30:00.640 --> 30:01.460
It doesn't taste good.

449
30:01.460 --> 30:02.250
It doesn't?

450
30:04.790 --> 30:06.190
I'll get you another one.

451
30:06.400 --> 30:07.660
I'll have another one.

452
30:18.200 --> 30:19.730
You're quite popular here.

453
30:20.090 --> 30:21.900
I received a lot of love letters.

454
30:21.900 --> 30:22.960
Can you believe it?

455
30:23.400 --> 30:24.960
Some of them are from your old fans.

456
30:24.960 --> 30:25.500
They said they

457
30:25.500 --> 30:27.360
watched me grow up over the years.

458
30:28.000 --> 30:28.790
Li,

459
30:29.050 --> 30:29.830
can you

460
30:29.830 --> 30:31.350
delete the videos with me in them?

461
30:31.350 --> 30:32.750
Why should I delete them?

462
30:33.530 --> 30:35.460
I just don't want to be abused by my girlfriend.

463
30:35.460 --> 30:37.290
A-Are you two together now?

464
30:37.700 --> 30:38.530
Not yet.

465
30:38.530 --> 30:39.250
I want to make

466
30:39.250 --> 30:40.760
a proper confession to her.

467
30:40.760 --> 30:41.980
We have a lot of classes now.

468
30:41.980 --> 30:43.330
Neither of us wants to fall behind in our studies,

469
30:43.330 --> 30:44.960
so I don't have time to prepare.

470
30:44.960 --> 30:46.080
So we talked about it

471
30:46.080 --> 30:47.500
decided to postpone my confession.

472
30:47.500 --> 30:49.760
You even need to discuss when to confess?

473
30:49.830 --> 30:51.560
Do you two discuss everything?

474
30:51.640 --> 30:52.440
Yeah.

475
30:52.900 --> 30:53.700
What's wrong?

476
30:55.240 --> 30:56.030
Nothing.

477
31:00.140 --> 31:01.290
Yun Ye, let me ask you something.

478
31:01.290 --> 31:01.900
Do you know

479
31:01.900 --> 31:03.430
who the TA for your class is?

480
31:03.740 --> 31:04.530
Who is it?

481
31:05.030 --> 31:06.290
You really don't know?

482
31:08.000 --> 31:09.030
I think it's a senior

483
31:09.030 --> 31:11.000
from our department.

484
31:11.830 --> 31:12.640
Why?

485
31:14.440 --> 31:15.240
It's Fu Shize.

486
31:15.900 --> 31:16.850
No way.

487
31:17.330 --> 31:17.980
You...

488
31:21.000 --> 31:22.140
Li, I swear

489
31:22.140 --> 31:23.540
I had no idea he was our TA.

490
31:23.750 --> 31:25.110
He wasn't there

491
31:25.110 --> 31:25.790
during registration,

492
31:25.790 --> 31:26.460
and in the group chat,

493
31:26.460 --> 31:27.590
he was always listed as the TA.

494
31:27.590 --> 31:29.110
And I didn't see him today.

495
31:29.380 --> 31:30.420
He just put my book

496
31:30.420 --> 31:31.770
at the back of the classroom.

497
31:31.770 --> 31:33.200
If I'd known it was him,

498
31:33.200 --> 31:34.400
I swear I would've...

499
31:37.140 --> 31:37.950
However...

500
31:38.660 --> 31:40.530
you two have been apart for so long.

501
31:40.530 --> 31:44.160
Seeing each other again shouldn't have stirred up any feelings, right?

502
31:44.160 --> 31:44.960
No.

503
31:46.050 --> 31:47.570
See?

504
31:50.140 --> 31:51.140
Hello, Yunyi.

505
31:54.240 --> 31:55.030
Li.

506
31:56.200 --> 31:57.830
I'm going out with Yunyi tomorrow.

507
31:57.830 --> 31:59.160
Can you tell Dad that...

508
32:10.140 --> 32:11.740
I left something in your car.

509
32:12.090 --> 32:13.350
Can I add you on WeChat?

510
32:48.750 --> 32:49.550
It's in my car.

511
32:50.010 --> 32:52.610
I'll have Yun Ye bring it to you on Monday, okay?

512
32:57.790 --> 33:00.120
I have an important experiment tomorrow.

513
33:01.790 --> 33:03.190
Then I'll bring it to you.

514
33:03.200 --> 33:04.000
Where are you?

515
33:10.790 --> 33:11.830
I'm not at school.

516
33:12.070 --> 33:13.670
Would tomorrow work for you?

517
33:15.370 --> 33:15.870
Okay.

518
33:49.900 --> 33:50.700
Thanks.

519
33:52.000 --> 33:53.640
Sorry for making you come all the way here.

520
33:53.640 --> 33:54.440
No worries.

521
33:54.460 --> 33:56.070
I'm free today anyway.

522
33:58.840 --> 34:00.240
So, what are you

523
34:00.960 --> 34:02.160
planning to do later?

524
34:02.790 --> 34:04.090
I haven't decided yet.

525
34:05.160 --> 34:06.340
You went out of your way to bring me the key.

526
34:06.340 --> 34:07.630
Let me buy you a drink.

527
34:07.790 --> 34:08.540
No need.

528
34:08.610 --> 34:10.340
I've got something to do later.

529
34:11.230 --> 34:13.429
Didn't you just say you hadn't decided?

530
34:16.400 --> 34:17.190
Where to?

531
34:19.340 --> 34:20.130
A cafe.

532
34:20.500 --> 34:21.300
Is that okay?

533
35:00.460 --> 35:01.260
Thank you.

534
35:05.360 --> 35:05.920
Let's go.

535
35:14.130 --> 35:14.990
Let's sit here.

536
35:20.150 --> 35:21.000
I'll go order.

537
35:22.090 --> 35:24.150
I want chocolate milk.

538
35:25.000 --> 35:27.400
Matcha cake for dessert, just like before?

539
35:27.960 --> 35:28.570
Yeah.

540
35:34.960 --> 35:36.730
He still remembers.

541
35:57.730 --> 36:00.360
You've changed a lot.

542
36:03.190 --> 36:04.000
I guess.

543
36:05.150 --> 36:05.960
Life

544
36:06.550 --> 36:08.080
is basically back on track.

545
36:09.030 --> 36:09.890
What about you?

546
36:10.150 --> 36:11.350
How are you doing now?

547
36:12.340 --> 36:14.150
I found an internship.

548
36:14.630 --> 36:16.360
What are your plans after that?

549
36:16.940 --> 36:18.940
I'll just secure a stable job first.

550
36:19.440 --> 36:20.150
This internship

551
36:20.150 --> 36:22.210
should lead to a full-time position.

552
36:23.590 --> 36:24.190
Mm-hmm.

553
36:26.650 --> 36:27.050
What about you?

554
36:27.050 --> 36:28.230
I heard from Fu Zhengchu

555
36:28.230 --> 36:30.030
that you came back for your Ph.D.

556
36:30.500 --> 36:32.630
I should be able to graduate this time.

557
36:35.300 --> 36:36.090
Senior?

558
36:36.230 --> 36:36.900
I was wondering why

559
36:36.900 --> 36:38.160
you weren't in the lab.

560
36:38.760 --> 36:39.550
Hello.

561
36:39.760 --> 36:41.230
Is this your girlfriend?

562
36:44.530 --> 36:45.940
She's so pretty!

563
36:49.190 --> 36:51.030
Hello, I'm Lin Jingran.

564
36:51.840 --> 36:52.630
Hello.

565
36:54.260 --> 36:56.090
Senior, can I sit here?

566
36:56.090 --> 36:56.840
No.

567
36:58.400 --> 36:59.190
Go away.

568
37:00.840 --> 37:02.500
Alright, I'll head back then.

569
37:02.550 --> 37:03.480
Bye, beautiful.

570
37:03.940 --> 37:04.960
Bye, Senior.

571
37:08.100 --> 37:08.910
Sorry.

572
37:08.940 --> 37:11.130
He likes to joke around.

573
37:11.630 --> 37:12.440
It's fine.

574
37:12.440 --> 37:14.440
People often joke with me like that.

575
37:17.080 --> 37:18.900
When I'm with Yun Ye.

576
37:27.940 --> 37:29.340
Are you graduating soon?

577
37:29.510 --> 37:30.110
Yeah.

578
37:30.960 --> 37:32.230
I'm writing my thesis.

579
37:33.460 --> 37:34.320
What about you?

580
37:35.340 --> 37:36.780
Yeah, almost.

581
37:40.860 --> 37:43.210
What are your plans after that?

582
37:47.440 --> 37:48.230
After that,

583
37:51.000 --> 37:51.930
I might go abroad

584
37:52.740 --> 37:53.650
for a postdoc.

585
37:58.070 --> 37:59.650
Alright.

586
37:59.690 --> 38:01.650
Are you going alone?

587
38:04.030 --> 38:06.150
Who else would I go with?

588
38:10.590 --> 38:11.550
No, I just...

589
38:11.550 --> 38:13.190
I just think going abroad alone

590
38:13.190 --> 38:14.190
is quite hard.

591
38:14.190 --> 38:14.940
That's it...

592
38:23.380 --> 38:23.940
No.

593
38:24.530 --> 38:25.590
It'll be just me.

594
38:30.090 --> 38:31.550
But I haven't decided yet.

595
38:31.800 --> 38:33.600
I might just stay in the country,

596
38:34.500 --> 38:36.550
or I might go abroad

597
38:37.300 --> 38:38.430
and never come back.

598
38:40.170 --> 38:41.340
N-Never come back?

599
38:42.210 --> 38:42.900
Yeah.

600
38:46.730 --> 38:47.730
It's pretty good.

601
38:54.300 --> 38:55.300
It's a good thing.

602
38:56.690 --> 38:58.690
I went to the UK last year

603
38:58.690 --> 39:00.090
for an exchange program.

604
39:03.500 --> 39:04.300
How was it?

605
39:05.100 --> 39:06.760
It was okay. It's just that...

606
39:06.860 --> 39:09.460
I couldn't get used to it for the first 6 months.

607
39:13.800 --> 39:15.090
So it was...

608
39:17.030 --> 39:18.090
not very good then?

609
39:21.080 --> 39:22.410
You can tell me about it.

610
39:27.090 --> 39:28.620
If it's convenient for you.

611
39:33.230 --> 39:34.400
Now that it's come up so suddenly,

612
39:34.400 --> 39:34.860
I don't even know

613
39:34.860 --> 39:36.840
where to start.

614
39:38.630 --> 39:39.530
It's okay.

615
39:40.190 --> 39:41.790
You can start from anywhere.

616
39:42.570 --> 39:44.230
Anywhere?

617
39:44.320 --> 39:44.920
Yeah.

618
39:47.540 --> 39:49.310
There's too much to say.

619
39:50.190 --> 39:51.850
We can talk as much as you want,

620
39:52.950 --> 39:53.970
as long as you don't have

621
39:53.970 --> 39:55.770
anything else to do later today.

622
39:59.730 --> 40:01.130
When I first got there,

623
40:01.130 --> 40:04.130
I wasn't used to the language,

624
40:04.130 --> 40:06.400
so I didn't dare to communicate with others.

625
40:06.400 --> 40:07.390
At that time,

626
40:07.420 --> 40:09.750
Tang Lin was in a different city because of

627
40:09.900 --> 40:11.240
changes to her project.

628
40:11.340 --> 40:12.940
So I had to live all by myself.

629
40:31.590 --> 40:34.000
But I got used to it in the second half of the year.

630
40:34.000 --> 40:35.230
At that time, I was always sharing

631
40:35.230 --> 40:37.130
technical knowledge on EAW in my spare time.

632
40:37.130 --> 40:39.130
My channel hit a bit of a milestone,

633
40:39.130 --> 40:40.930
reaching 3,000,000 followers.

634
40:40.950 --> 40:42.260
When things were difficult back then,

635
40:42.260 --> 40:43.860
I would read those comments.

636
40:44.970 --> 40:46.370
They encouraged me a lot.

637
40:48.530 --> 40:50.400
Forget it. It was nothing special.

638
40:50.400 --> 40:51.650
It was just okay.

639
40:53.000 --> 40:54.800
I originally thought I definitely wouldn't

640
40:54.800 --> 40:56.650
be able to make it there on my own.

641
40:57.230 --> 40:58.510
I didn't expect to be so good

642
40:58.510 --> 40:59.770
at fending for myself.

643
41:09.050 --> 41:10.510
Do you want to go see my lab?

644
41:18.730 --> 41:19.650
Oh no, Senior!

645
41:19.900 --> 41:21.430
Junior crashed the system!

646
41:23.380 --> 41:25.440
Senior, you go ahead with your thing.

647
41:25.730 --> 41:26.940
It's not a big deal.

648
41:28.050 --> 41:28.960
It's okay.

649
41:29.150 --> 41:30.260
You go ahead.

650
41:33.090 --> 41:33.900
Alright then.

651
41:34.300 --> 41:35.900
I'll show it to you next time.

652
41:36.150 --> 41:37.690
Alright. It's fine.

653
41:40.680 --> 41:41.950
I'll get going then.

654
41:48.170 --> 41:48.860
Senior,

655
41:48.940 --> 41:50.050
is she really not your girlfriend?

656
41:50.050 --> 41:51.300
Just admit she is.

657
41:52.840 --> 41:53.630
She's not.

658
41:55.460 --> 41:56.690
You are chasing her?

659
41:57.340 --> 41:58.730
Just tell me.

660
41:58.840 --> 41:59.980
We'll help you chase her.

661
41:59.980 --> 42:01.050
You talk too much.

662
42:01.320 --> 42:01.850
Let's go.

663
42:09.340 --> 42:10.600
Look at this young man.

664
42:10.760 --> 42:11.730
Looks sharp.

665
42:11.800 --> 42:12.900
He's a high school teacher.

666
42:12.900 --> 42:14.700
He looks honest at first glance.

667
42:15.650 --> 42:18.190
He looks sharp or honest? Give me an accurate description.

668
42:18.190 --> 42:19.260
Is that the point?

669
42:19.940 --> 42:20.690
If our Yun Li

670
42:20.690 --> 42:21.960
gets together with him,

671
42:21.960 --> 42:23.890
they can teach their kids themselves.

672
42:23.890 --> 42:26.590
Helping their kids with homework won't be a problem.

673
42:26.590 --> 42:28.340
You're thinking too far ahead.

674
42:29.150 --> 42:30.030
Look at this one.

675
42:30.030 --> 42:31.360
This one is even better.

676
42:32.690 --> 42:33.760
A local from Xifu.

677
42:34.860 --> 42:36.190
He has a master's degree

678
42:36.400 --> 42:37.660
and is a civil servant.

679
42:39.940 --> 42:42.340
You're not the one looking for a boyfriend.

680
42:42.760 --> 42:44.440
Stop meddling.

681
42:44.530 --> 42:45.730
When it comes to this,

682
42:45.800 --> 42:46.590
you should let her

683
42:46.590 --> 42:48.000
find someone she likes.

684
42:48.150 --> 42:50.760
These days, people believe in the freedom to choose their own partners.

685
42:50.760 --> 42:52.050
Freedom to choose their own partners?

686
42:52.050 --> 42:53.500
Freedom has its limits,

687
42:53.500 --> 42:54.090
right?

688
42:54.190 --> 42:54.860
If we don't

689
42:54.860 --> 42:55.730
look out for her,

690
42:55.730 --> 42:57.730
what if she gets taken advantage of?

691
42:59.560 --> 43:00.350
Lili.

692
43:02.930 --> 43:04.090
I made some soup for you.

693
43:04.090 --> 43:05.090
I'll go heat it up.

694
43:05.090 --> 43:06.300
Okay. Thanks, Mom.

695
43:06.940 --> 43:07.670
Yun Li, Yun Li.

696
43:07.670 --> 43:08.730
Come here and look.

697
43:10.050 --> 43:11.090
Your third aunt

698
43:11.400 --> 43:13.260
has found you a few more young men.

699
43:13.260 --> 43:14.590
I went through them all,

700
43:14.630 --> 43:16.630
and this one seems pretty reliable.

701
43:16.630 --> 43:17.550
He's from Xifu,

702
43:17.630 --> 43:19.630
has a master's degree, and graduated 2 years ago.

703
43:19.630 --> 43:20.760
He's a civil servant

704
43:21.050 --> 43:22.150
with a steady income

705
43:22.150 --> 43:23.210
and good benefits.

706
43:23.340 --> 43:24.530
It's a regular nine-to-five job,

707
43:24.530 --> 43:25.300
so he'll have time for family.

708
43:25.300 --> 43:25.940
Dad.

709
43:26.020 --> 43:26.770
What's wrong?

710
43:26.770 --> 43:28.000
You don't want to meet this guy too, do you?

711
43:28.000 --> 43:28.730
Come on.

712
43:29.340 --> 43:30.860
This time, you have to.

713
43:30.910 --> 43:31.700
Your third aunt

714
43:31.700 --> 43:33.190
cares so much about your marriage.

715
43:33.190 --> 43:34.360
You just keep turning her down.

716
43:34.360 --> 43:35.440
Is that appropriate?

717
43:35.440 --> 43:36.650
Stop worrying about me.

718
43:36.650 --> 43:37.230
I can take care of myself.

719
43:37.230 --> 43:39.260
Stop worrying about you?

720
43:39.730 --> 43:40.860
If you were taking this seriously yourself,

721
43:40.860 --> 43:42.460
would I have to worry so much?

722
43:42.500 --> 43:43.230
Look at yourself.

723
43:43.230 --> 43:44.300
How old are you now?

724
43:44.500 --> 43:45.630
Don't end up like your cousin.

725
43:45.630 --> 43:46.500
She's been on 20 or 30 blind dates

726
43:46.500 --> 43:47.400
and still hasn't found anyone she likes.

727
43:47.400 --> 43:48.150
Who knows how long

728
43:48.150 --> 43:49.530
she'll keep this up?

729
43:49.630 --> 43:51.380
I just don't like being set up like this.

730
43:51.380 --> 43:52.690
The process doesn't matter.

731
43:52.690 --> 43:54.110
The result does!

732
43:54.230 --> 43:56.000
Dad, let me see if he's handsome.

733
43:56.000 --> 43:57.260
Why are you butting in?

734
43:57.300 --> 43:58.050
You think just because I'm talking to your sister,

735
43:58.050 --> 43:59.180
you're off the hook?

736
43:59.940 --> 44:00.960
You didn't get into college

737
44:00.960 --> 44:01.690
to...

738
44:03.000 --> 44:03.800
Dad, I know.

739
44:03.800 --> 44:04.860
I'll go check on Li.

740
44:05.230 --> 44:05.730
Wait!

741
44:07.690 --> 44:08.650
These two kids.
